  "summary": "The most likely Red trio remains p0, p6 and p7. Attempt 8 further corroborates p1's Blue funding; p6's mixed funding warrants some uncertainty about allegiance versus personal incentives. Only p0 and p2 are confirmed. Blue probabilities sum to 5.00.",
  "player_memory": "After A8: score B1:R3; M5 threshold30 crew5, chair p1. p0 confirmed Red Loyalist/Recolorer; p2 badge Blue. PBlue: [0,.99,1,.94,.94,.97,.08,.08]. A8 p1's apparent9B plus own18R and B→R exactly explain delta8B19R. p1/p5 repeatedly Blue-funded. p6 likely paid16R A3 but mostly Blue A7; p7 substantial Red A6. p3/p4 untested, likely Blue by count. Reports/pledges remain claims; personal goals can explain mixed behavior."
